# Netlify preview proxy example; NOT installed on cartrade.live.
# Apply only after resolving the backend staging deployment in the approved workspace.
# Keep these BEFORE any SPA catch-all redirect.
#
# Path on cartrade.live: /ops/solicitudes
# Proxy target: CarTrade resolver (must have buyer_ops.py deployed and flags reviewed).
#
/ops/*  https://cartrade-resolver.onrender.com/ops/:splat  200
